			"Message": "docs(Echo): Add GitHub badge table and reformat README for readability\n\nAdd a compact GitHub badge table (last-commit, issues, stars, downloads) to the README header for at-a-glance repo stats. Soft-wrap all long paragraph text at ~80 characters to improve terminal and diff readability. Replace the old markdown funding partner table with an HTML version that renders consistent logo sizing and alignment.\n\nThese changes are cosmetic only — no content or link changes. The badge table is progressive enhancement for GitHub render; nothing depends on it programmatically.",
